NAME 
	man
	
SYNOPSIS

	this is a program that merges function and system calls to manipulate
information on your device! we hope this is simpler...

COMMAND SUMMARIES

	man - prints this whole manual, have fun reading.

	ls - lists all files in a directory

	env - prints the collection of system variables and values.

COMMAND EXPLANATION

	man - Print text that fully elaborates on what commands are doing 
	on a programic level. 

	The command prints this entire document or a command's file specified.
	this happens by opening the 'manual' directory and opening the command 
	manual file and writes it to the terminal.

	RETURNS
	 0 - successfully prints a file of a command to new Window.
	-1 - failed to find file.
	-2 - failed to run command.
	-3 - failed to print.

